  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">St Helena Financial Aid 2026 to 2029</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UK Government is committed to meeting the reasonable needs of the citizens of St Helena. This bridges the gap between the domestic revenues and the costs of delivering public services on the island such as health and education. This includes bringing in necessary international expertise to provide skills and experience not available on island and maintaining access to the island. The programme also supports work to build St Helena&#x2019;s tourism offer, attracting investment and realising the benefits of the UK funded airport, within a safe and secure environment.</narrative>
  </description>
